  ],
  "eng_for_hin:pod-1:SC09-S06": [
   ["Yes, the salmon and the risotto are both gluten-free.","हाँ, सैल्मन और रिज़ोटो दोनों ग्लूटेन-मुक्त हैं।","cb4587ae-7ffe-41c5-8ff4-38a466e7f573","3b552bee-238d-4791-ab4f-d2f595f9ee69"],
   ["We also have some salads.","हमारे पास कुछ सलाद भी हैं।","eaa2ea0d-7f78-49a3-9d5c-8bb643568ce2","5242edb9-9ebe-4643-8329-80d59dae2627"]
  ],
  "eng_for_hin:pod-1:SC09-S08": [
   ["The lamb is excellent.","लैम्ब बहुत बढ़िया है।","47f95686-b1e2-4b48-83ae-5fb7e353f2ac","338bdba7-f3b5-4fc2-b308-bb406e9071f3"],
