   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","और टूथपेस्ट आपको उसी मोड़ के पास मिल जाएगा।","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","bd7a7185-b4c1-4194-b2b0-ed4275a4992b"]
